OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Fallow temperatures to drop off
OL,7,Ftonight, with some mist and fog
OL,8,Fpatches developing in prone locations.
OL,9,FRemaining breezy along southern
OL,10,Fcoasts, in a northeasterly direction.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FAgain, a bright start,
OL,13,Fleading into patchy clouds and long
OL,14,Fsunny spells through Tuesday. Brisk
OL,15,Fnortheasterly winds with stronger
OL,16,Fgusts along the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
